      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0007",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "Adding an App Clip target to your project as described in [`Creating an App Clip with Xcode`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppClip/creating-an-app-clip-with-xcode) enables a capability called On Demand Install Capable for the App Clip target.",
      "normalizedSource": "Adding an App Clip target to your project as described in [`Creating an App Clip with Xcode`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppClip/creating-an-app-clip-with-xcode) enables a capability called On Demand Install Capable for the App Clip target.",
      "sourceHash": "6f879b4f7bf02196967848a2e1971e4af610537da69e04d1904061d981d20e70",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Discussion",
